# Internal dev/AI scratch notes — keep these out of the public repo.
# (Curated docs live in docs/ and README.md and are committed normally.)
# If a doc matching one of these patterns ever needs tracking: git add -f <file>
*_ANALYSIS*.md
*_FIX*.md
*_SUMMARY.md
*_EXPLAINED.md
*_REVIEW.md
*_QUICK_REF.md
*_TROUBLESHOOTING.md